# Daemon Runtime Data - Do NOT Commit

# ============================================================================
# SENSITIVE: These files contain runtime state and conversation IDs
# ============================================================================

# Logs (change every cycle)
logs/*.log
logs/activity.log
logs/persona-voice.log

# Conversation ID (SENSITIVE - unique session identifier)
memory/conversation-id.txt

# Runtime timeline (changes constantly)
memory/persona-timeline.jsonl

# Runtime metrics and state
metrics/success-rates.json
metrics/switch-history.jsonl
metrics/last-emotional-trigger.json
personalities/state.json
triggers/emotional.json

# Completed task logs (daily runtime data)
tasks/completed/*.md

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.lock
*.backup-*

# ============================================================================
# SAFE TO COMMIT: Configuration, definitions, and static files
# ============================================================================
#
# ✅ All .sh scripts
# ✅ personalities/archetypes/*.md (persona definitions)
# ✅ personalities/traits.json (trait evolution config)
# ✅ triggers/*.json (circadian, emotional, chaos configs)
# ✅ tasks/queue.md (can be committed, gets modified)
# ✅ tasks/reflection-prompts.md
# ✅ tasks/inter-persona-dialogue.md
# ✅ memory/AWAKENING.md (static)
# ✅ memory/emergence-log.md (can be committed)
# ✅ hooks/* (if any)
# ✅ All documentation (README.md, QUICKSTART.md, etc.)
logs/state-audit.jsonl
state/checkpoints/*.tar.gz
